From 6f355f9707407a0ad2356bd4da6bb1a027d98e40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Siyuan Feng <sealseacat@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 23:36:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] chore(repo): community and adoption infrastructure
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- ADOPTERS.md with a low-friction path for listings (PR or issue, anonymous
  entries allowed) and an explicit invitation for 'decided against' feedback
- Issue forms: bug report (with a no-real-data checklist), feature request,
  and an adopter-feedback template that treats rejection reports as
  first-class roadmap input
- PR template wired to the CONTRIBUTING rules (regression test with every
  fix, changelog entry, 3.9 compatibility)
- CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md (Contributor Covenant 2.1)
- CITATION.cff so the project is citable (GitHub 'Cite this repository';
  Zenodo reads it when archiving releases — DOI slot annotated)

